  "content": "<h1>光之方块 Luminax</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.satherov.dev%252f%2523%252freleases%252fdev%252fsatherov%252fluminax%252fluminax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/maven-metadata/v?metadataUrl=https://maven.satherov.dev/releases/dev/satherov/luminax/luminax/maven-metadata.xml&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Maven&amp;logo=apachemaven&amp;color=C71A36\" alt=\"Maven\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crystalix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1165932?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Downloads&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/SathLabs/Luminax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Luminax-181717?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><p>这款极为简单的模组为游戏添加了少量纯色方块。</p><p>你可以使用<strong>光之魔杖</strong>来改变方块的色彩和光照强度。</p><p>本模组完全支持与<strong>镶框方块</strong>联动。</p><p>目前包含的方块类型有：</p><ul>\n<li>完整方块</li>\n<li>台阶</li>\n<li>楼梯</li>\n<li>墙</li>\n<li>压力板</li>\n<li>按钮</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1165932/description_dd30c320-85da-4f1d-b44d-88991e3b097c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
